## What is included

| Artifact | Upstream path | Content |
|---|---|---|
| `data/diagnostics/canboat_pgn_reference.json` | `docs/canboat.json` (Version 8.1.0, SchemaVersion 2.6.0) | 628 NMEA-2000 PGN records (PGN numbers 59392–131012) |
| `data/diagnostics/canboat_pgn_reference.json` (`j1939` section) | `database/j1939/pgns/065226-activeTroubleCodes.yaml` | J1939 PGN 65226 (DM1, Active Trouble Codes) field layout |
