The license text above is reproduced verbatim from the upstream `LICENSE` file.
`data/diagnostics/canboat_pgn_reference.json` additionally carries
`_source_license: "Apache-2.0"` and `_source_ref` on **every** PGN record.

> Apache-2.0 §4(d): if the Work includes a "NOTICE" text file, any derivative
> distribution must include a readable copy of the attribution notices it
> contains. CANboat's repository ships `LICENSE` (reproduced above) and its
> README carries the copyright attribution (reproduced above). No separate
> upstream `NOTICE` file exists at the pinned commit; this file records that
> fact and preserves the attribution text instead of inventing one.
